{"3736040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cozy Farm", "steam_appid": 3736040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> 🐾<br>Welcome to <i>Cozy Farm</i>, a charming farm sim where you play as <strong>Cozy the Cat</strong>, a hardworking feline with a love for the land! Plant crops, raise animals, and build your dream farm—all while managing your day in this somewhat realistic, heartwarming farming simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌽 Grow crops like corn, potatoes, grass, and turnips<br>🐓 Care for cows, sheep, and chickens<br>⛏️ Mine ore, collect wild honey, and forage for cherries<br>🛠️ Upgrade your tools and expand your farm<br>💰 Sell animal products, crops, and resources to grow your farm even bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each day, you'll need to manage your time wisely—should you harvest turnips, care for your chickens, or head to the mines? It’s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re tending to animals, upgrading your gear, or just enjoying the peaceful rhythm of country life, <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> is the purr-fect escape for players who love relaxing sim games with a dash of strategy and a whole lot of charm.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐾 <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> 🐾<br>Welcome to <i>Cozy Farm</i>, a charming farm sim where you play as <strong>Cozy the Cat</strong>, a hardworking feline with a love for the land! Plant crops, raise animals, and build your dream farm—all while managing your day in this somewhat realistic, heartwarming farming simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌽 Grow crops like corn, potatoes, grass, and turnips<br>🐓 Care for cows, sheep, and chickens<br>⛏️ Mine ore, collect wild honey, and forage for cherries<br>🛠️ Upgrade your tools and expand your farm<br>💰 Sell animal products, crops, and resources to grow your farm even bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each day,